@host = https://localhost:7105
@ownerPassword = SET_YOUR_BOOTSTRAP_OWNER_PASSWORD
@superAdminPassword = SET_YOUR_BOOTSTRAP_SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN

### Tenant A login (copy accessToken to token above)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "owner",
  "password": "{{ownerPassword}}",
  "tenantId": "tenant-a"
}

### Identity associated with the token
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customers in the authorized tenant database
GET {{host}}/crm/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Job orders and billing
GET {{host}}/crm/job-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assigned service tasks
GET {{host}}/crm/job-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Payment history
GET {{host}}/crm/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Super Admin login: omit tenantId for platform administration
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "{{superAdminPassword}}"
}

### Use the Super Admin token for this request
GET {{host}}/master/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
